      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<h1>OpenClaw 生态日报 2026-10-02</h1>
<blockquote>
<p>Issues: 500 | PRs: 500 | 覆盖项目: 13 个 | 生成时间: 2026-10-02 03:34 UTC</p>
</blockquote>
<ul>
