</li>
<li><p><strong><a href="https://huggingface.co/ISTA-DASLab/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-GSQ-RCO-GGUF">ISTA-DASLab/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-GSQ-RCO-GGUF</a></strong>
