<td><a href="https://blog.arduino.cc/2026/10/01/an-arduino-uno-q-lets-this-vintage-terminal-answer-questions-without-internet-access/">An Arduino® UNO™ Q lets this vintage terminal answer questions without internet access</a></td>
<td>Arduino Blog</td>
<td>Arduino UNO Q 携手复古终端实现 <strong>本地离线 LLM 问答</strong>，代表 Arduino 在边缘 AI 推理方向的首次系统性尝试，对低功耗离线智能终端意义重大。</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>2</td>
<td><a href="https://hackaday.com/2026/10/01/elgato-key-lights-get-matter-upgrade/">Elgato Key Lights Get Matter Upgrade</a></td>
