<td><strong>#6759</strong> fix(tools): shell 任务保留、输出增量、子进程生命周期<br>长任务结束后仍可调用、轮询返回新增字节、非交互命令收到 EOF、取消/超时负责子进程清理。（已 CLOSED）<br>🔗 <a href="https://github.com/Hmbown/Codewhale/pull/6759">https://github.com/Hmbown/Codewhale/pull/6759</a></td>
<td>🟢 工具链</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>9</td>
<td><strong>#6761</strong> feat(providers): 新增 Cheaper Inference 描述行<br>通过现有 bundled provider 路径接入，复用 Chat Completions 与目录发现端点。（已 CLOSED）<br>🔗 <a href="https://github.com/Hmbown/Codewhale/pull/6761">https://github.com/Hmbown/Codewhale/pull/6761</a></td>
<td>🟢 提供方生态</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>10</td>
