      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<h1>OpenClaw 生态日报 2026-10-01</h1>
<blockquote>
<p>Issues: 485 | PRs: 500 | 覆盖项目: 13 个 | 生成时间: 2026-10-01 03:34 UTC</p>
</blockquote>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw">OpenClaw</a></li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/HKUDS/nanobot">NanoBot</a></li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/nousresearch/hermes-agent">Hermes Agent</a></li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/sipeed/picoclaw">PicoClaw</a></li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/qwibitai/nanoclaw">NanoClaw</a></li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/nullclaw/nullclaw">NullClaw</a></li>
